 ## 3. Test
 Log in, open your account, pick a plan, pay with card `4242 4242 4242 4242` (any future date, any CVC). You should return to the site and see "Your plan: GY ..." and a "Manage subscription" button.
 
-## Notes
-- Games can call `GY.plan()` (returns "plus", "pro", "max" or null) and `GY.isSubscriber()` to unlock perks.
-- S-Bux, wallpapers, VIP tags and admin access are NOT built yet. Only the plan badge shows today. Build the perks before taking real payments.
