 S-Bux tools, staff sign-in

---
 INSTALL.md                 |   8 +-
 index.html                 | 175 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 supabase/subscriptions.sql |  49 +++++++++++
 3 files changed, 229 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/INSTALL.md b/INSTALL.md
